From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: deepak1556 <hop2deep@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 18 May 2020 11:12:26 -0700
Subject: allow disabling blink scheduler throttling per RenderView

This allows us to disable throttling for hidden windows.

With backgroundThrottling disabled, hiding the view leaves the renderer shown
but hides its Windows input HWND. Restore both when the page becomes visible
again, or precision touchpad input falls back to mouse-wheel delivery.

